{"id":"galapagos-islands","name":"Galapagos Islands","qid":"Q38095","country":"Ecuador","locality":"Galápagos Province","lat":"-0.666666666","lon":"-90.55","built":"1535","year":1535,"year_text":"1535","century":"16th century","era":"Early modern","period":"","date_basis":"Wikidata, discovered","style":"","heritage":"World Heritage Site","type":"archipelago; WWF ecoregion","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Galápagos_Islands","text":"The Galápagos Islands (Spanish: Islas Galápagos) are an archipelago of volcanic islands in the Eastern Pacific, located around the equator, 485 nautical miles (898 km; 558 mi) west of the mainland of South America. They form the Galápagos Province of the Republic of Ecuador, with a population of slightly over 33,450 in 2020. The province is divided into the cantons of San Cristóbal, Santa Cruz, and Isabela, the three most populated islands in the chain.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gal%C3%A1pagos_Islands","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[{"id":"gh-fe6693ede791","w":1197,"h":1200,"title":"Galápagos Islands ESA23188644.jpeg","o":"gh-fe6693ede791.jpg","credit":{"text":"European Space Agency","license":"Attribution","license_url":"","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gal%C3%A1pagos_Islands_ESA23188644.jpeg","via":"Wikimedia Commons"}}],"depictions":[{"id":"civilization-vi--galapagos-islands","game":"civilization-vi","name":"Galápagos Islands","verified":false,"text":"","text_source":"","text_license":"","images":[{"id":"gh-a22f70fba7bd","w":668,"h":704,"o":"gh-a22f70fba7bd.webp","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VI, © 2K; Aspyr.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Natural_Wonder_Gal%C3%A1pagos_Islands_bonuses_(Civ6).png","via":"Fandom (civilization)","note":"Fandom upload by Xanthos of Thebes on 2018-05-26"}},{"id":"gh-p843d0f73dac","w":1200,"h":864,"o":"gh-p843d0f73dac.png","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VI, © 2K; Aspyr.","source":"https://civilizati